WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.190
In the Qing dynasty there was a writer named Cao Xueqin.

00:00:03.244 --> 00:00:06.688
He was born into a wealthy and noble family, but later his family fell into decline.

00:00:06.738 --> 00:00:10.502
Light snow was falling outside the window, but inside the room it was warm.

00:00:10.502 --> 00:00:14.342
He lived in a simple, humble cottage and devoted himself to writing his book.

00:00:14.342 --> 00:00:17.737
With ten years of heartfelt effort, he wrote Dream of the Red Chamber.

00:00:17.877 --> 00:00:21.163
He often wrote late into the night, forgetting to eat.

00:00:21.163 --> 00:00:24.012
The story takes place in the beautiful Grand View Garden.

00:00:24.012 --> 00:00:27.350
Jia Baoyu and Lin Daiyu were reading beneath the flowers.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:31.304
The sisters in the garden composed poems and played together.

00:00:31.304 --> 00:00:34.747
The Jia household was once lively and wealthy, with a constant stream of guests.

00:00:34.747 --> 00:00:38.033
The maidservants carried tea and refreshments as they walked by softly.

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:41.505
But the beautiful dream slowly faded, and the family declined.

00:00:41.505 --> 00:00:44.958
Every character in the book is vivid, as if a real person.

00:00:44.958 --> 00:00:48.398
The once lively garden slowly grew quiet.

00:00:48.398 --> 00:00:51.722
Dream of the Red Chamber is hailed as the pinnacle of classical Chinese fiction.

00:00:51.722 --> 00:00:54.433
For more than two hundred years, readers have always loved it.

00:00:54.433 --> 00:00:57.110
People have passed this book down from generation to generation.
